## Context

The author asked for a higher bar at rung 3 and above, read through his values:
Excellence, Integrity, Care (2026-09-23). The criteria are named in
`plugins/sdt-sitter/TESTING.md`; the numbers are not, and `SPEC.md` owns every
design number, so they are measured here and ratified before they bind.

## Actions

Measure on the Menagerie rung, then propose to the author:

- Excellence: coverage (pack or named reason for every eligible attachment),
  consecutive passes required, time budget per rung.
- Integrity: cache records matching packs on disk, no uninstall residue, pause
  holding mid-document, each assertion seen red.
- Care: longest interface freeze, CPU and memory ceilings, status text true and
  readable by a screen reader (0807), a reason given when the cache empties
  (0774), the user told during a long silent stage (0793).

## Exit criteria

The proposed numbers, each with its measurement, ruled by the author in
`DECISIONS.md` and written into `SPEC.md`.
